    "updated_at": "2020-10-04T16:49:07Z",
    "body": "So this was actually [fixed upstream](https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/21587) by setting `$VIRTUAL_ENV_PROMPT`. But this will only be avalible in python3.10 😞.\r\n\r\nBecause of the way it gets hardcoded I've actually implemented a [hacky workaround](https://github.com/agnoster/agnoster-zsh-theme/pull/86/commits/1d489efdd015aaa60838bf8f5f346706438a7702) for my zsh theme - would a similar solution be accepted here?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
